  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support to programme formulation of Priority 2 on `Supporting the people of Zambia to reach their potential and build resilience&#xbf; of the MIP 2021-2027 for Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The specific objective of this assignment is to contribute to developing formulation documents for Priority 2 on `&lt;em&gt;Supporting the people of Zambia to reach their potential and build resilience&lt;/em&gt;&#xbf; of the EU MIP 2021-2027 for Zambia, composed of three objectives:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Improving reproductive, sexual, maternal, new-born, child and adolescent and child health, including nutrition;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Strengthening basic education with focus on Early Childhood Education and Development (ECED);&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Enhancing technical and vocational education and training (TVET) and skills development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The requested services for the assignment will include the provision of technically sound and economically viable input to the development of an EU intervention proposal, as schemed in the MIP 2021-2027 under Priority 2. The consultants will be tasked to support with contents the elements of the programme design, composed of an Annotated Strategic Steering Committee (SSC) Fiche, an Action Document and Annexes. Specifically support will be sought in the area of theory of change, programme indicative activities, gender analysis and mainstreaming, logical framework matrix, geographical coverage, implementation modalities, budget.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
